# 2x2 matrix such as SWOT (business, strategy), with nodes placed on a grid.
layout layered
page 16:9
font 9pt..28pt
node s "Strengths" row=1 col=1
| loyal users
| fast support
node w "Weaknesses" row=1 col=2
| slow builds
node o "Opportunities" row=2 col=1
| new markets
node t "Threats" row=2 col=2
| cheaper rivals
